#### SAP BTP Bookshop & AI Service REST HTTP Test Suite ####
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004

### 1. Health & Readiness Probes
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz
Accept: application/json


### 2. Catalog & Discount Endpoints
### Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Book
Accept: application/json

### Get a single book (ID 201)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Book(201)
Accept: application/json

### Get all authors
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Author
Accept: application/json

### Get all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Order
Accept: application/json

### Call Python-backed discount function
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/discount(title='The%20Bestseller')
Accept: application/json


### 3. AI Service Endpoints (/ai)

### 3a. Single-turn AI Ask - Mistral Nemotron (BTP Destination: mistralai-mistral-nemotron)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Recommend top 2 technology books and explain why.",
  "model": "mistralai/mistral-nemotron"
}

### 3b. Single-turn AI Ask - Google DiffusionGemma 26B (BTP Destination: google-diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What are the core concepts of software architecture?",
  "model": "google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it"
}

### 3c. Single-turn AI Ask - Google Gemma 4 31B Instruct (BTP Destination: google-gemma-4-31b-it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Explain the difference between microservices and monoliths.",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it"
}

### 3d. Single-turn AI Ask - Z-AI GLM 5.2 (BTP Destination: z-ai-glm-5-2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Summarize the benefits of cloud native applications.",
  "model": "z-ai/glm-5.2"
}

### 3e. SAP HANA Vector Engine RAG Search (/ai/ask_rag)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask_rag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Which bestseller books are available in stock with fantasy themes?",
  "model": "mistralai/mistral-nemotron"
}

### 3f. Stateful LangGraph Agentic Workflow (/ai/ask_agent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask_agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is the discounted price for classic books?",
  "model": "google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it"
}

### 3g. Real-Time Server-Sent Events (SSE) Streaming (/ai/ask/stream)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Provide a quick overview of cloud design patterns.",
  "model": "z-ai/glm-5.2"
}